      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "過去に盗まれたブツの在処がわかったのさ。\nアラゴ王国の最北西、ソリダス地方の\nイアペトス大洞窟だ。探索を頼みたい。\n口止め料込みで報酬は弾ませてもらう。",
        "official_en": "A while back something was stolen from... It's not\nimportant. I'm looking for someone to get it back.\nThe Iapetus Cavern, northwest of Arago. There's a\nreward, including extra if you keep quiet.",
        "real_en": "A while back something was stolen from... It's not\nimportant. I'm looking for someone to get it back.\nThe Great Iapetus Cave, northwest of Arago. There's a\nreward, including extra if you keep quiet."
      },
